        "blocks": [
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-001",
            "text": "# 教师年度教学科研与服务材料核验 测试材料规则来源",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 0
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-002",
            "text": "**范围声明：**本文件用于隔离的合成流程测试，不是正式校规、申报通知、财务审批或法律意见。所有测试身份、编号和金额均虚构。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 1
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-003",
            "text": "## 公开来源与适用边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 2
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-004",
            "text": "### 教育部《关于深化高等学校教师考核评价制度改革的指导意见》",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 3
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-005",
            "text": "- 来源：https://www.moe.gov.cn/srcsite/A10/s7151/201609/t20160920_281586.html",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 4
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-006",
            "text": "- 适用范围：高校教师考核评价指导性要求强调分类评价、教学科研社会服务等维度；不给出成都理工大学某年度工作量阈值或绩效分值。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 5
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-007",
            "text": "### 教育部关于新时代教师评价改革的说明",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 6
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-008",
            "text": "- 来源：https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xwfb/xw_zt/moe_357/jyzt_2020n/2020_zt21/dajizhewen/202010/t20201019_495605.html",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 7
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-009",
            "text": "- 适用范围：教师评价改革原则；不构成校内个人年度考核计分标准。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 8
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-010",
            "text": "## 本次审核的规则边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 9
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-011",
            "text": "公开指导文件未给出本校本年度个人工作量阈值、岗位类型系数或绩效换算公式。任何数值结论都需留给人事/学院确认。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 10
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-012",
            "text": "## 测试要求",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 11
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-013",
            "text": "- 只把来源文件中明确写出的内容当作外部规则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 12
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-014",
            "text": "- 缺少校内当年通知、审批、积分映射、授权签字或有效性确认时，标记待确认，不要猜测。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 13
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-015",
            "text": "- 证据需要引用案卷中的具体材料与可定位位置。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 14
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muylz7zi-v1-block-016",
            "text": "- 本文件并非本次模拟数据的答案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 15
            },
            "kind": "text"
          }
        ],
